= Zhu De

Starting as a military officer in Yunnan during the 1911 revolution and subsequently in the National Protection Army, Zhu De gained an appreciation for Marxism while studying in Europe and the Soviet Union. He has since joined the Communist Party as one of their preeminent officers.

